+puts "============"
+puts "Modeling Algorithms - Fillet of the start wall of a thread kept tangent at its root"
+puts "(FreeCAD screw: edges of the start wall, radius 0.8)"
+puts "============"
+puts ""
+
+# Near the fillet of the root (radius 1) the walking keeps the center of the
+# ball in the section plane and the surfdata after the one on the fillet of
+# the root starts with a hook on the wall, a sharp bend where the tangency
+# was lost. That start is left to a filling which replaces the surfdata on
+# the fillet of the root, tangent to its neighbors and to both faces.
+restore [locate_data_file freecad_screw_wall_profile.brep] b
+explode b E
+
+blend result b 0.8 b_95
+
+checkshape result
+checkmaxtol result -ref 1.83e-4
+checkprops result -v 8707.03 -s 3017.3
